      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FIX (spa/src)\nmain.ts: if inside an iframe and the URL\nhas state=, call\nbroadcastResponseToMainFrame()\n(@azure/msal-browser/redirect-bridge)\nand do NOT bootstrap Angular.\nSame redirect URI as login, so no new\nEntra registration.\napp.ts: timed_out, invalid_grant,\nlogin_required -> loginRedirect.\nTested on Keycloak only.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FIX (spa/src)\nmain.ts: if inside an iframe and the URL\nhas state=, call\nbroadcastResponseToMainFrame()\n(@azure/msal-browser/redirect-bridge)\nand do NOT bootstrap Angular.\nSame redirect URI as login, so no new\nEntra registration.\napp.ts: timed_out, invalid_grant,\nlogin_required -> loginRedirect.\nTested on Keycloak only.",
      "autoResize": true,
